#
# Archived audit reports are byte-exact copies of the reports delivered by the
# audit session. Some of them carry Markdown hard breaks (two trailing spaces
# on consecutive blockquote lines). The documentation channel of
# local-validation runs "git diff --check" on the increment, which would fail
# on those records. Records keep their bytes: only the archived copies are
# exempt, and the index and any authored file in this directory keep the
# default check.
audit-*.md whitespace=-blank-at-eol
